{"id": "69362", "title": "何春传奇史", "author": "杨家何春", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 16, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69362.htm", "intro": "类似风月的情色玄幻小说~~~\r\n龙者，能大能小，能升能隐，大则兴云吐雾，小则隐介藏行，升则飞腾于宇宙之间，隐则潜伏于波涛之内，龙之潜，乃龙之必腾。方今春深，龙乘时变化，犹人得志而纵横四海，龙之为物，可比世间英雄。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69362", "chapters": [{"title": "1-2", "file": "10615975.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3-4", "file": "10615976.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10615977.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10615978.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10615979.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10615980.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10615981.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10-12完结", "file": "10615982.html", "available": false}, {"title": "新编何春传奇史1", "file": "10615983.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10615984.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3-4", "file": "10615985.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5-6", "file": "10615986.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-8", "file": "10615987.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9-10", "file": "10615988.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "10615989.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10615990.html", "available": false}]}